@startuml g4_6_4_stint_timeline
title Strategy Stint / Compound Timeline Architecture (G.4.6.4)

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #0F172A

package "Authoritative Strategy Pipeline (G.4.5)" {
    [StrategyOptimizer\n(G.4.5.5)] as Optimizer
    [RankingResult\n(Authoritative Ranking)] as RankingRes
    [SimulationResult\n(Stints & Pits)] as SimRes
}

package "View-Model Transformation Layer (G.4.6.1)" {
    [StrategyDashboardAdapter] as Adapter
}

package "Presentation & Timeline UI Layer (G.4.6.4)" {
    [Selected Scenario ID\n(st.session_state)] as SessionState
    [prepare_stint_timeline_data] as ViewPrep
    
    package "Stint Timeline Presentation" {
        [Summary KPI Header] as SummaryHeader
        [Gantt Stint Timeline Visual] as GanttChart
        [Compound Transition Table] as TransitionTable
    }
}

Optimizer --> RankingRes : Produces Top-K
RankingRes --> Adapter : Consumed Read-Only
SimRes --> Adapter : Supplies Stint & Pit Summaries

SessionState --> ViewPrep : Passes scenario_id
Adapter --> ViewPrep : Supplies stint & pit DataFrames

ViewPrep --> SummaryHeader : Render KPIs
ViewPrep --> GanttChart : Render Start/End Laps & Compounds
ViewPrep --> TransitionTable : Render Stint Laps & Pit Transitions

note right of ViewPrep
  **READ-ONLY PRESENTATION**
  * NO Sensitivity Analysis
  * NO Monte Carlo Analysis
  * NO Re-ranking / Scoring
  * NO Simulation Rerun
  * NO Constraint Re-validation
  * NO Optimization
  * NO ML / LLM
end note

@enduml
